      <uighur>bodulγatai</uighur>
      <cyrillic>бологотой</cyrillic>
      <transcript>BODULΓATAI</transcript>
      <definition>[= bodulγatu] adj. Thoughtful, having an intention, plan, or aim, intending to; discriminating, judicious, circumspect, careful.</definition>
      <page>110</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠣᠳᠣᠯᠭᠠᠲᠠᠢ ᠺᠦᠮᠦᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- kymyn</transcript>
          <definition>Thoughtful, circumspect, levelheaded or sober-minded person; pensive person.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠥᠰᠦᠨ ᠪᠣᠳᠣᠯᠭᠠᠲᠠᠢ ᠪᠡᠷ</unicode>
          <transcript>tøsyb -- ber</transcript>
          <definition>According to plans or calculations.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
